 S6(1,'gold-rimmed-dinner-plate-centre-set-table-top-down','A wide gold-rimmed fine white dinner plate sits empty at a fully set place on the white tablecloth, heavy silver cutlery on both sides and filled crystal glasses above it.','Camera straight down, 50mm lens, f/5.6. The plate sits on the centre line, its flat centre filling about 50 percent of the frame width, sharp; the cutlery runs symmetrically on both sides; the glasses at the top throw golden caustics on the cloth beside the plate, never over its centre.','THE PLATE CENTRE IS PLAIN MATTE WARM WHITE PORCELAIN, an even flat circle inside the thin gold rim, nothing on it.','the plate centre',comp='A'),
 S6(2,'brass-framed-plaque-white-marble-wall-by-glass-door','At the restaurant entrance, a slim brass-framed plaque is mounted on a white marble wall beside a tall glass door, in warm evening light.','Camera at eye height, 50mm lens, f/5.6, square to the wall. The plaque fills about 35 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp, its brass frame catching the light; the edge of the glass door at one side reflects the street and glows warm from the dining room inside.','THE PLAQUE FACE IS PLAIN MATTE WARM WHITE ENAMEL, flat inside its thin brass frame, crisp corners, nothing on it.','the plaque face',comp='A'),
 S6(3,'frosted-glass-door-panel-dusk-street-reflections','From the street at dusk, the tall glass door of the restaurant: a large frosted panel in its centre, the warm glowing dining room behind, soft reflections of the street lights on the clear glass around it.','Camera on the pavement at eye height, 50mm lens, f/4, square to the door. The frosted panel fills about 45 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp; the bronze door frame runs straight; pale reflections of the street drift across the clear glass at its edges, never over the panel; warm chandelier glow inside.','THE FROSTED PANEL IS PLAIN EVEN MILKY WHITE GLASS, flat, crisp edges, nothing on it.','the frosted panel',comp='A'),
 S6(4,'luxury-shopping-bag-bronze-bar-champagne','A luxury paper shopping bag with satin ribbon handles stands on the polished bronze bar beside a dark champagne bottle and two full flutes.','Camera at counter height, 85mm lens, f/4, square to the bag front. The bag front fills about 45 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp, flat and upright; the bottle and flutes at one side sparkle, their caustics falling on the bronze beside the bag; warm amber bokeh behind.','THE BAG FRONT IS PLAIN THICK MATTE WARM WHITE PAPER, flat and crisp at its folded edges, nothing printed on it.','the bag front',comp=None),
 S6(5,'host-stand-ipad-bronze-stand-white-flowers','At the host stand of the restaurant, our iPad stands upright in a polished bronze stand on a white marble counter beside a crystal vase of white peonies with no leaves.','Camera at counter height, 85mm lens, f/4, square to the screen. The screen fills about 45 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp, square-on; the peonies glow softly at one side; candlelit dining room in warm bokeh behind.','THE SCREEN SHOWS A PLAIN WHITE FULL-SCREEN IMAGE, evenly lit edge to edge, crisp corners inside its thin black border, nothing on it.','the screen',comp=None,refs=['ipad']),
 S6(6,'tall-menu-board-bronze-easel-entrance-candlelight','A tall menu board stands on a slim bronze easel at the entrance of the restaurant, the candlelit dining room glowing behind it.','Camera at standing height, 50mm lens, f/4, square to the board. The board fills about 45 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp, upright; behind it the room of white tablecloths, crystal and candles falls into soft warm bokeh; a polished marble floor reflects the light.','THE BOARD FACE IS PLAIN MATTE WARM WHITE, flat inside a thin bronze frame, crisp corners, nothing on it.','the board face',comp='A'),
